+/// Position::slide_attacks_king() answers whether the king of kingColor is
+/// attacked after the SLIDE move m is made - judged on the board the slide
+/// leaves, the king where he ends. A king that fell into a pit is reported
+/// as attacked when he is the mover's own (the move is illegal) and as not
+/// attacked when he is the enemy's (no check: the game is over).
